# Copy to `.env` in this `frontend/` directory if you need to override the API origin.
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with `VITE_` to browser code.
#
# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset in local `npm run dev`. The SPA then calls /auth on the
# Vite origin and vite.config.ts proxies those requests to uvicorn (default 127.0.0.1:8001).
# Only set this when you must talk to an API on another host (not the Vite proxy).

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001
